{"seq":3,"slug":"unloading-memory","title":"卸载与内存预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/streaming/unloading-memory","wordCount":1699,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"卸载与内存预算\">卸载与内存预算</h1><p>加载是流送里被讲烂的一半，卸载却是被忽视、也更容易出 bug 的另一半。一个只会加载不会卸载的系统，在玩家走遍地图后必然把 10GB 预算填满然后崩溃。卸载的难点不在「删掉对象」，而在「什么时候删才安全又不浪费」「删了内存碎片怎么办」「删了又马上要用怎么办」。这一篇讲内存预算这本总账，以及卸载侧的滞后、垃圾回收、对象池三件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>卸载和加载是同一本账上的借贷两方：加载从内存预算里「借出」额度，卸载「归还」额度，系统必须让账面常驻量维持在预算线下。卸载由距离触发，但触发后还要走一段「冷却—注销—释放—回收」的安全流程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[内存预算&lt;br/&gt;常驻上限 如 10GB] --&gt; B{当前占用 &gt; 高水位?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[挑选卸载候选&lt;br/&gt;最远/最久未用]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[维持现状]&#10;    C --&gt; E[卸载滞后检查&lt;br/&gt;d &gt; r_unload 且冷却到期]&#10;    E --&gt; F[注销 Actor&lt;br/&gt;移出 tick/碰撞/场景图]&#10;    F --&gt; G[释放引用&lt;br/&gt;资源引用计数减一]&#10;    G --&gt; H[垃圾回收&lt;br/&gt;真正归还内存]&#10;    H --&gt; I{资源会很快复用?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[进对象池 不真释放]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[彻底释放]\">flowchart TD\n    A[内存预算&lt;br/&gt;常驻上限 如 10GB] --&gt; B{当前占用 &gt; 高水位?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[挑选卸载候选&lt;br/&gt;最远/最久未用]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[维持现状]\n    C --&gt; E[卸载滞后检查&lt;br/&gt;d &gt; r_unload 且冷却到期]\n    E --&gt; F[注销 Actor&lt;br/&gt;移出 tick/碰撞/场景图]\n    F --&gt; G[释放引用&lt;br/&gt;资源引用计数减一]\n    G --&gt; H[垃圾回收&lt;br/&gt;真正归还内存]\n    H --&gt; I{资源会很快复用?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[进对象池 不真释放]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[彻底释放]</pre><p>整套机制的目标是把常驻内存钉在预算线下，同时不因为卸得太急、太频、太碎而引入新卡顿。下面分四块讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存预算-高低水位与分类配额\">内存预算：高低水位与分类配额</h2><p>内存预算不是一个数，而是一套<strong>分类配额 + 水位线</strong>。先把可用内存按类别切：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>典型占比</th>\n<th>是否流送管理</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>引擎/系统常驻</td>\n<td>固定</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>引擎本体、UI、永久资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流送 cell 资源</td>\n<td>最大头</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>网格、纹理、碰撞、逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纹理流送池</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>是（独立池）</td>\n<td>mip 级别动态调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音频流送</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>流式音轨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临时/分配缓冲</td>\n<td>浮动</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>加载中转、解压缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>流送 cell 资源那一块再设<strong>高低水位</strong>：占用超过高水位（如预算的 90%）就主动触发卸载，把占用压回低水位（如 75%）才停手。两条水位之间留缓冲，避免占用在阈值上反复横跳引发卸载抖动——这和 <a href=\"distance-based-streaming\">按距离流送</a> 的距离滞后是同一种思想，只不过这里的「滞后」作用在内存维度。当玩家闯入高密度区导致占用逼近高水位，系统会比距离规则更激进地卸载远处 cell，「保近舍远」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卸载滞后与冷却-别急着卸-别反复卸\">卸载滞后与冷却：别急着卸，别反复卸</h2><p>卸载侧的滞后在 <a href=\"distance-based-streaming\">按距离流送</a> 已经埋下伏笔：卸载半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{unload}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大于加载半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{load}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，cell 走出加载半径后还要再走出那条缓冲带才卸。但仅有距离滞后不够，还要加<strong>时间冷却</strong>：cell 离开卸载半径后，不立即卸，而是挂一个冷却计时器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{cool}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">coo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，期间若玩家掉头回来，cell 还在内存里，直接复用，省掉一次完整重载。</p>\n<p>冷却带来的额外常驻内存是可估的：设玩家平均往返周期内滞留在「该卸但未卸」状态的 cell 数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{cool}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">coo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，单 cell 平均内存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则冷却的内存成本约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{cool}\\cdot\\bar{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">coo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这是一个典型的<strong>内存换流畅</strong>权衡：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{cool}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">coo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越长，掉头复用率越高、重载越少，但常驻内存越高。预算紧张时缩短冷却，预算宽裕时拉长。冷却到期且仍在卸载半径外，才真正进入注销流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"垃圾回收-注销不等于释放\">垃圾回收：注销不等于释放</h2><p>很多引擎（含 UE）用引用计数 + 垃圾回收（GC）管理对象生命周期，这给卸载埋了一个坑：<strong>「注销 Actor」和「内存真正归还」是两件事</strong>。注销只是把 Actor 移出场景图、tick、碰撞，并解除引用；内存要等 GC 跑一轮、确认没有任何引用还指着它，才真正回收。</p>\n<p>这带来两个工程现实。其一，<strong>卸载有延迟</strong>：你以为卸了，内存还没下来，得等下一轮 GC，所以内存峰值往往出现在「卸载已发起、GC 尚未跑」的窗口里，预算要为这个窗口留余量。其二，<strong>悬挂引用会阻止释放</strong>：如果某个全局管理器、某个未清理的委托、某段逻辑还偷偷引用着被卸 cell 里的对象，GC 就回收不掉它，造成「卸了却没省内存」的泄漏，玩家走得越远泄漏越多直至 OOM。这类泄漏是开放世界最常见的内存 bug，定位手段见 <a href=\"../practice/streaming-debugging\">流送调试与卡顿</a>。GC 本身也要时间切片——一次全量 GC 可能卡几毫秒，所以现代引擎用增量式 GC 把回收摊到多帧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对象池-高频复用的不真释放\">对象池：高频复用的不真释放</h2><p>有些资源被反复加载卸载——子弹、特效、常见植被、敌人，玩家每跨一个 cell 都要新建一批同款。对这类高频对象，「卸载就真删、要用再真建」是浪费：构造和析构本身有成本，频繁分配还会把内存搞得<strong>碎片化</strong>，最后即便总空闲够，也凑不出一块连续大块给新 cell。</p>\n<p><strong>对象池（object pooling）</strong> 的做法是预先创建一批对象放进池子，「卸载」时只是重置状态、放回池里（不真析构、不归还内存），「加载」时从池里取一个复用（不真构造）。这把高频对象的分配/释放成本压到接近零，也避免了碎片。代价是池子占着一块常驻内存，所以只对真正高频、且实例上限可预估的对象类型用池。对象池和卸载流程的关系是：卸载逻辑要识别「这是池化对象」，走「归还池」而非「释放」分支。它也是 <a href=\"../continuity/persistent-world-state\">世界状态持久化</a> 里「重建被卸对象」的常见载体——从池里取一个再灌入保存的状态，比从磁盘重载快得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>卸载是流送的另一半，只加不卸必然填满预算崩溃；难点是「何时卸才安全又不浪费」。</li>\n<li>内存预算是分类配额 + 高低水位：超高水位主动卸到低水位，两线缓冲避免占用在阈值上反复横跳。</li>\n<li>卸载滞后（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{unload}&gt;r_{load}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）加时间冷却 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{cool}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">coo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 让玩家掉头时能复用 cell，成本约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{cool}\\cdot\\bar{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">coo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的常驻内存，是内存换流畅的权衡。</li>\n<li>GC 让「注销」与「释放」分离：内存有回收延迟（峰值出现在卸载已发起、GC 未跑的窗口），悬挂引用会阻止释放造成「越走越泄漏」的开放世界经典 bug。</li>\n<li>对象池对高频复用对象「归还而非释放」，消除分配成本与碎片，也是持久化重建对象的快速载体。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>卸载半径与距离滞后的来源：<a href=\"distance-based-streaming\">按距离流送</a></li>\n<li>加载侧的流水线与时间切片：<a href=\"async-loading\">异步加载与 IO 预算</a></li>\n<li>被卸对象的运行时状态如何保活：<a href=\"../continuity/persistent-world-state\">世界状态持久化</a></li>\n<li>跨库——通用内存管理与碎片治理：<a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/memory-management\">性能优化 · 内存管理</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"卸载与内存预算","id":"卸载与内存预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"内存预算：高低水位与分类配额","id":"内存预算-高低水位与分类配额"},{"level":2,"text":"卸载滞后与冷却：别急着卸，别反复卸","id":"卸载滞后与冷却-别急着卸-别反复卸"},{"level":2,"text":"垃圾回收：注销不等于释放","id":"垃圾回收-注销不等于释放"},{"level":2,"text":"对象池：高频复用的不真释放","id":"对象池-高频复用的不真释放"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"异步加载与 IO 预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/streaming/async-loading"},"next":{"title":"无缝接缝","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-streaming-open-world/continuity/seamless-transitions"}}